# The files that go into the Cornerstone API image. The build context is the repo root, so the list starts empty.
# The image keeps the workspace files, the lock file, the source of the pipeline and the API, the deploy script,
# and the tracked data of the pipeline as the seed. Docker reads this file because it sits beside apps/api/Dockerfile.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/pipeline/pyproject.toml
!apps/pipeline/README.md
!apps/pipeline/src
!apps/pipeline/data
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/src
!apps/api/deploy
apps/pipeline/data/cache
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
